  "id": "vectors-test",
  "title": "Field boundary tiles 2025 (test)",
  "description": "TEST collection \u2014 candidate renderings of the 2025 Fields of the World PRUE predictions (1.58B field polygons), built with geoparquet-io (A5 aggregation) and tylertoo (tiling). fields-2025-thinned.pmtiles runs the raw polygons through tylertoo's generalization ladder from z0. cells-2025-r5/r7/r8.pmtiles are single-layer A5 cell aggregates (verbatim z0\u20138; per-cell count, area_ha, avg_confidence, pct_covered) at three cell sizes for side-by-side evaluation; the same aggregates are published as GeoParquet (cells_r5/r7/r8.parquet). Aggregates use the 2025 subset with >350 km\u00b2 artifact polygons excluded. Styles cover field count, coverage, average field size and model confidence per resolution, plus per-field confidence and size on the thinned archive.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "keywords": [
    "agriculture",
    "field boundaries",
    "Fields of the World",
    "FTW",
    "global",
    "PRUE",
    "Sentinel-2",
    "confidence"
  ],
